  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">좋은 영상(차이나는 클라스, 선을 넘는 녀석들 등) 10~15분짜리+</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">영상과 관련된 책(차이나는 클라스 초대손님 저서 정도) 일부를 읽고 의미있는(학생들에게 꼭 알려주고 싶은 내용, 평소에 대충 알고 있었는데 아~! 하게 만들고 싶은 부분) 문장의 단어 몇 개를 지워서 퀴즈로 제시.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&lt;파란하늘 빨간지구&gt;를 읽다가 의미있는 문장들을 만나고, 학생들에게 이걸 어떻게 소개하면 좋을까 생각하다가 이렇게 구성해봤습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>도서평(난이도 및 흥미도) : 중학생에게 추천하기는 아주 어려운 책입니다. 저도 계속 읽히지 않았어요. 교양서 수준으로 접근했는데 전공서 느낌이 나서 그랬던 것 같아요.</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">준비물 : 관련도서1권, 모둠별 화이트보드, 마카펜, 지우개</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1.조천호-차이나는 클라스 영상(교체가능) </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1) </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I54onl1tkdU&amp;t=31s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I54onl1tkdU&amp;t=31s</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I54onl1tkdU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dgfEd3/hyOZF6nnOa/iWC3KejWOWZvRKkU2L7kR0/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=268_103_363_206\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I54onl1tkdU\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2) </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZsS5nEfKgk\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZsS5nEfKgk</a></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3) </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qTs0-mfpQPY&amp;t=3s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qTs0-mfpQPY&amp;t=3s</a> &#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4)</span> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ekHbodnTDQ\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ekHbodnTDQ</a><span style=\"color: #1155cc;\">Y </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5) </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tW0IOqZbJto\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tW0IOqZbJto</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2.&lt;파란하늘 빨간지구&gt; 발췌 퀴즈</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1183bam\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.miricanvas.com/v/1183bam</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9f063843458d8f33e2a5c6befd0004e2ca8752e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9f063843458d8f33e2a5c6befd0004e2ca8752e\" data-origin-width=\"1703\" data-origin-height=\"904\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7aa47a01daaee44875b02ee68f3e06d30461472\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7aa47a01daaee44875b02ee68f3e06d30461472\" data-origin-width=\"1695\" data-origin-height=\"878\"><div class=\"figcaption\">원인 제공자, 피해자, 이웃, 미래세대</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1&#160;:&#160;우연,&#160;화석연료,&#160;산업혁명,&#160;이산화탄소 <br>2&#160;:&#160;원인&#160;제공자,&#160;피해자,&#160;이웃,&#160;미래세대 <br>3&#160;:&#160;90&#160; <br>4&#160;:&#160;구름,&#160;추워,&#160;이산화탄소</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
